    "observations": [
      "Repeated association wording resolves uniquely inside own exact citation context; distinct own occurrences remain ambiguous.",
      "One indexed selection pass changes unresolved quotation fields only and binds the original row, source hash and full proposal. Failed/unknown/stale selections preserve gaps.",
      "Heading and first own body paragraph stay contiguous and never cross the next heading; repeated indexed options retain physical coordinates.",
      "Source highlights convert Python scalar offsets to browser UTF-16; scoped subquotes need current parent containment.",
      "Initial C140 recognized separate actual expense, request and award; final recheck retained substantive time/cost rights but varied source-outcome coverage and introduced an accounting-date documentation-gap statement.",
      "The clarified row identity recovered a rejected C139 quote in a retained-source diagnostic; the earlier saved partial result remains unchanged.",
      "Award-minus-expense balance text persisted after prompt change; a visible review warning now requires independent payment and allocation evidence without modifying the raw recommendation."
    ],
    "limits": [
      "Synthetic development draws only; no independent legal gold, held-out/repeated-seed or causal accuracy estimate.",
      "Original quote location does not certify statement kind, polarity, subject relation, date role, applicability or legal correctness.",
      "One saved C139 result remains partial; diagnostic recovery is not a silently substituted production result.",
      "Final C140 accounting-date gap was projected as an unknown incurred-cost statement; separate temporal-gap scope and comprehensive statement recall need work.",
      "Native graph includes an If Linden Owner Ltd organization candidate, broad payment types and one withheld execution structure item. Automatic entity/classification correctness remains unproven.",
      "Award is not actual payment; prompt guidance did not remove all wrong balance recommendations. The narrow lexical review warning is not a payment detector or calculation validator.",
      "The intermediate 19-call payment recheck used the previous copied prompt; not revised-prompt evidence.",
      "Graph neighborhood is bounded by traversal/snapshot context, not proven entire contract understanding.",
      "No Go engine, LayaGo/GLiNER/MLX architecture/training/speed changes. Reused engine default 68."
    ],
